<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Arial', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>07 · RESULTS (1/6)</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        In 12 of 19 cells the chain arm does no better
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 290, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 54, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FF6B6B', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>12 / 19</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>cells with Λ &lt; 0, across both chain arms</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>−0.098</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>median over 303 run-level readings</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>−0.859</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>most stable negative: op_tm × A3, 75 readings</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#93A8C2', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                A <span style={{ color: '#FFFFFF' }}>cell</span> is one task × one chain arm; its value is the
                <span style={{ color: '#FFFFFF' }}> mean of that cell&apos;s usable runs</span>.
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#93A8C2', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                <span style={{ color: '#FFFFFF' }}>19 cells, median −0.010</span> · 303 readings, median −0.098.
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', width: 780 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 780 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#16233A', padding: '10px 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 420, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Cell — task × chain arm</Text>
                    <Text style={{ width: 166, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', textAlign: 'right' }}>Λ via A3</Text>
                    <Text style={{ width: 166, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', textAlign: 'right' }}>Λ via A4</Text>
                </Box>
                {[
                    ['pb26_homopolymer_density', '+0.638', '#35D0A5', '−0.532', '#FF6B6B'],
                    ['op_dielectric_constant_total', '+0.116', '#35D0A5', 'not run', '#6B7F98'],
                    ['pb_t3_iwlt', '+0.068', '#35D0A5', '+0.170', '#35D0A5'],
                    ['pb26_polymetrix_tg', '+0.005', '#35D0A5', '−0.473', '#FF6B6B'],
                    ['pb_t1_tg', '−0.004', '#FF6B6B', '−0.549', '#FF6B6B'],
                    ['pb_t2_permeability', '−0.008', '#FF6B6B', '+0.003', '#35D0A5'],
                    ['op_tg', '−0.010', '#FF6B6B', 'not run', '#6B7F98'],
                    ['pb_t2_modulus', '−0.016', '#FF6B6B', '+0.028', '#35D0A5'],
                    ['pb_t1_tm', '−0.192', '#FF6B6B', '−0.296', '#FF6B6B'],
                    ['op_tm', '−0.859', '#FF6B6B', 'not run', '#6B7F98'],
                    ['pb_t3_dielectric_loss', '−1.479', '#FF6B6B', '−0.905', '#FF6B6B'],
                ].map(([cell, a3, c3, a4, c4]) => (
                    <Box key={cell} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', padding: '7px 14px', background: '#0E1728', borderBottom: '1px solid #1A2639' }}>
                        <Text style={{ width: 420, fontSize: 17, color: '#C3D0E2' }}>{cell}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ width: 166, fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: c3, textAlign: 'right' }}>{a3}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ width: 166, fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: c4, textAlign: 'right' }}>{a4}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ width: 780, fontSize: 15, color: '#FFB020', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                The largest positive is +0.638 (homopolymer density) — but only 6 of its 15 readings are computable, so it is a reading, not a result.
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC', width: 900, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
            A3 was never tuned, A2 was tuned 30 times — part of the negative sign may be tuning asymmetry, not chain harm.
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>8 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
